WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.467
Your website changes all the time. Your SEO needs to keep up.

00:00:05.467 --> 00:00:13.333
Your team merges a homepage update. It looks good, but the main shopping button now leads to a missing page.

00:00:13.333 --> 00:00:22.067
Your Optimiser checks the changed page and follows its links. It confirms the broken link and a missing page description.

00:00:22.067 --> 00:00:33.333
The agent reads the existing website, restores the working link, and writes a description using the page's own content. It tests the proposed changes.

00:00:33.333 --> 00:00:41.633
Your team reviews a focused fix, with a clear explanation of what changed and why. You choose when it goes live.

00:00:41.633 --> 00:00:52.033
After deployment, the agent checks the website again. The collection opens, and the page description is restored. That closes this issue.

00:00:52.033 --> 00:01:01.133
The next update only changes the spacing. Your Optimiser checks it and leaves it alone. No unnecessary fix or review.

00:01:01.133 --> 00:01:09.033
Checks continue between updates, too. Your team keeps building. Your Optimiser keeps watching.

